WEBVTT

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:39.360
Sasshi and Arumi are from Osaka...

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.450
...but they're stuck, lost in mysterious worlds...

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:45.360
...and they're having a hard time finding their way back to their birthplace, Abenobashi.

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:47.700
Starting with a Sword and Sorcery Shopping Arcade...

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.670
...they went to a Sci-Fi Shopping Arcade...

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.430
...where everything and anything was made of mecha...

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.880
A mecha Kouhei-san and a mecha Papa.

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:58.340
The Abeno Angels, dressed in sexy space outfits.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.930
Sasshi and Arumi get on board a combining robot...

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:02.930
...and defeat the enemy, a machine beast!

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:06.850
Now, the place they've jumped to today is...

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:11.550
Well, it looks similar, but it doesn't seem quite right...

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.840
We've ended up in a weird place again.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.540
The writing's all in Chinese characters here.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.060
Hold on a sec, Arumi.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.210
If it's all in Chinese characters, that means...

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:28.910
Yeah?

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:31.340
If it's all in Chinese characters, that means...

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.780
So, what does it mean?!

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.380
It's gonna be real tough to read.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.370
You know!

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:39.490
Come, come, please welcome to drop by! Please welcome to drop by!

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.790
Hey, I wonder why there's a crowd over there?

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.430
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.820
Aren't you at least curious?

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.520
Sometimes bargains start the very day you lay eyes on each other.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:51.590
Tourists, come on over.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.980
Wow, what a brilliant knockoff.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:59.270
These are no knockoffs please! They are imitations please!

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.570
How about it, Miss? Wouldn't you like one?

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:06.700
Today's special was commissioned by Louis XV of the French Dynasty!

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:09.320
Super deluxe t-shirt!

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.720
That's so lame. It's just got it written on there.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.910
What's so super deluxe 'bout it?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.840
The price is mega expensive, you see!

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.190
Don't want it.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.380
This is amazing!

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.330
Baisan and Atranger!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.960
Oh, this one over here is great, too!

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:24.760
It's the first time I've ever seen a Sasutaker knockoff!

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.520
I've had enough of robots already.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:31.500
You sure never grow up, Sasshi.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.360
It's cute.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.510
You sure never grow up.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.360
Does little Arumi-chan want this doll?

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:43.680
N...

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.780
Not really.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.720
Hey, it's a panda!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.160
What's a panda doing here?

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.210
Hey, Spot, Spot.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:52.890
C'mere, Spot.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.580
Why's a panda "Spot"?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.200
Spot, Spot, Spot, Spot. Spot, Spot, Spot, Spot.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:59.270
C'mon, look over here, Spot.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.790
It's a panda, darn it!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.000
Spot, Spot!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.450
It ain't the same size as before!

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.040
What's a pot doing here?!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.380
Sasshi, watch out!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:50.040
I don't get it. Why a dumpling?

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.180
Onii-chan!

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:56.980
Onii-chan!

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:02.360
Onii-chan, you really are alive!

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.530
Hey!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.700
What are you doing to my big brother?!

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:10.970
Your big brother?!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:14.070
That's right! He's Mune-mune's big brother!

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.470
This color, this smell...

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.110
...and this chewy, soft...

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.050
...texture. Right?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.090
You know, Sasshi ain't got a kid sister.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:32.100
'Sides, no matter how ya look at it, you're older than him.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.190
Huh?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.560
Well?! I bet you can't refute that!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.600
That's right! Onii-chan!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.030
Please win against the Golden Claw next time for sure!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.270
Okay.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.740
Listen to me when I'm talking!

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.400
So, what's the Golden Claw?

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:47.970
My son!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.280
My son, so you are alive!

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.550
Stop it!

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.500
What the heck is the premise this time?

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.130
Are you not the Golden Claw, who not only killed my eldest son...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.620
...but also stole a doll, which was our family treasure?!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:15.300
What a mega explanatory sounding line.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:19.470
Oh, I see! So, that's the premise this time!

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:23.610
Let's see, a doll, the family treasure, got filched.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.080
Don't note it, don't note it.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.700
Ni hao, bon jour, you stinking old man.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:32.410
If you want to avenge him, enter the combat tournament I sponsor.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:37.920
I am using the doll that I stole from Monsieur as the prize.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.420
What language was that?

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.400
Wh-Wh-Wh-What did you say?!

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.400
By that, you mean that you will be participating in...

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.600
...the next combat tournament that you are holding...

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.770
...and that you will fight us as well?!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.300
"Wh-Wh-Wh-What did you say?! By that, you mean..."

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:53.040
Don't note it word for word.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.560
Well, then, everyone, Adios! Amigo!

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.250
And his last words are in Spanish for some reason.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:05.320
"Combat tournament, the one left out sucks up ants." Right.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.650
There you have it. That was the Golden Claw.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.610
That was?

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:13.090
Please win against him this time, Onii-chan!

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.330
Win? In what?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.690
Here you are.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.490
Huh?

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:25.000
Please take the copy. Now, you are all set to enter the tournament.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.210
Thank you very much!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.210
What's it say?

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:31.580
"Every applicant participating in the combat tournament...

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.250
...will be purchasing a high class feather futon, and all-purpose...

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.280
...Taisho Japanese harp that can even be played in the bath...

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:39.720
...and various other things totaling 700 items."

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.780
What the heck? So, they're not giving it to us?

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.490
We don't need any of that stuff.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:49.920
"If you do not wish to purchase these items, please notify us within eight days of applying."

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:53.560
Hey, the application date is written as being two weeks ago!

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.330
Sasshi, you've been swindled!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:56.800
What?!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.470
There, I've delivered the merchandise that you ordered.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.150
What's combat tournaments and corrupt business practices...

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:06.610
...got to do with each other?!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.150
Beats me.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.010
Well, there's your total.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.010
That's steep.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.430
Oh, you can't pay for it?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.310
I didn't buy it!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.250
So, you can't pay for it.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.390
I see.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.520
If you can't pay for it...

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.520
...you'll have to undergo the...training.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:25.480
Wha? Training?

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.270
Training, like...

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:28.770
For what?

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:34.030
So, you are the one who wishes to marry my daughter?

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.780
I've had enough of these messed up turns of events.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:41.250
It's the first time your grandpa showed up, Sasshi.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.190
You there, Miss...

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.620
...you think I am just an ordinary old man, do you not?

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.820
Very well.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.760
Come at me however and whenever you wan...

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.820
Wait a sec...

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.270
Hey, I said, wait. I need to prepar...

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.510
I won.

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:12.510
How about it?! Behold my secret technique!

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:15.580
I can still stand, even after the beating I took.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.740
That's worthless.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.490
Well, that is not important.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:22.050
Let us begin the training to learn my secret technique.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.890
Summon the acting master.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:33.260
You two had better prepare yourselves.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:39.890
You're...

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.180
Well?! I bet you can't get your jaw off the floor!

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.350
Oh, it's just you, Spot.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.820
He is the acting master!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.910
Do not take him lightly.

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:01.240
Any who wish to master the technique must bow to the panda.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:07.200
This acting master will now put you through the training of terror in all 36 chambers...

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.600
This temple has 36 training chambers.

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:14.770
You will be required to clear all of them.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.300
Is this for real? All he's said is, "Ugah!"

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.890
Shut up! Quit grumbling! Let's go!

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.790
Now, I shall teach you the weight of 4,000 years of Chinese tradition...

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:32.480
...until you become sick of it, so prepare yourself!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.750
In the past, during the era of the first emperor of Qin...

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.560
...when soldiers prepared for battle...

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.200
...they valued spiritual strength over military tactics...

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:39.870
Um...

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.700
...and in order to strengthen their spirits...

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.730
They've both already left...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:41.730
...to say nothing of physical strength...

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.370
Adrian!

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:34.860
I have nothing left to teach you.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:36.630
Ugah!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:41.050
Onii-chan!

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:45.330
Onii-chan, you've finished your training, haven't you?!

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:51.440
Huh?

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.540
What does this mean?

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.300
Ugah!

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:12.260
What'll I do?

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.890
You had training, so won't it work out somehow?

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:19.970
I don't really get it, but is Papa the one we need to defeat this time?

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.260
You mean, Papa's the goblin in this world?

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:24.610
Right.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.680
Oh, gimme that Super Ab-Machoness 3.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.840
I don't know...

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.720
Listen to me!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.610
Considering the pattern from last time and the one before that...

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:36.740
...part of me feels like there's gonna be some mega huge opponent, but...

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.620
I want that Super Ab-Machoness 3 after all.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:39.710
I said, listen!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.860
So, we meet again.

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.190
It appears there is some fate linking us.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.050
Oh, it's the nice mister!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.960
The key chain mister!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.500
Mister?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.930
What? This is the mister you bought the key chain from?

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:54.300
How come you know this mister, too?

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.120
Mister...

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.430
Who are you calling a mister?!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.110
Don't you have a power stone or something that works miracles, Mister?

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:02.640
What about a Seven Divinities of Good Fortune wallet...

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.970
...that really increases your luck getting money, Mister?

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.010
C'mon, Mister.

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.310
I'm telling you not to call me mister!

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:14.270
So, here's the ultimate item that this bro suggests you get!

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:19.020
Outfit That Makes You Feel Stronger!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.100
It only makes me feel like it?!

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.720
Anyway, just do as bro says and try throwing a punch!

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.700
Oh, this is amazing!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:32.840
There!

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.140
This is retarded.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:37.110
Like I said, it's the ultimate item...

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:40.270
"Outfit That Makes You Feel Stronger!"

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.760
Makes me feel like it? You mean, it just makes noises?

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:49.750
Well, at any rate, if you gain confidence, your abilities tend to follow suit.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.550
I'll see you around.

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.590
Onii-chan!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.270
You absolutely must win!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.300
If you do...

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.360
Here she is again.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.370
This smell...

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:04.800
What? What?

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:09.600
Onii-chan, your clothing still has the price tag on it!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:10.870
I'll take it off right away.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.210
There!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.210
I can't breathe.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.160
There, there!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.640
There, there!

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.150
I'm going on ahead.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.780
Hey, wait!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.950
Now, things are getting started here!

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:26.090
Abenobashi Shopping Arcade Golden Claw Scramble Combat Tournament!

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:35.070
Furthermore, to the winner of this tournament goes...

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:40.150
...this doll!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:42.580
And now, finally, I present to you...

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.380
...the Abenobashi Shopping Arcade Combat Tournament!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.940
It's here at last.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.200
Keep it together and go for it!

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.540
Here's the final round.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.060
The final round already?!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.060
What the heck?

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.850
So, these two're the only ones who ended up participating anyway!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.720
I have to hand it to you for coming this far without running away, mon amour.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:10.830
But I am the one who will win.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:17.750
You think you can scare me with that fancy-shmancy pose?!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.710
If you're not gonna hurry up and get started...

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.920
I'll come at you first!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.470
Hey, hey, you're running away.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.290
Hang in there, Onii-chan!

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.780
He's strong. Is that really Papa?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.630
I'll let you off at that for today...

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:46.090
Boy, you have any final words to leave the world with?

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:52.350
It can make all the noise it wants...

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:53.900
...but it doesn't help one bit when what's inside is weak.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.420
Damn it, making such good swinging noises...

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.990
If you gain confidence, your abilities tend to follow suit.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.360
Then gimme something that works better!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.930
But, now that he mentions it, ever since we came to this freaky world...

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.100
...things worked out just by following the forms.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.580
Just the form...

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.410
The form...

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:24.880
Form...

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:34.130
My goodness!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:35.680
Sasshi just...

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.650
He looks so lame, 'cause his proportions are mega wrong.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.040
And next up is...

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:00.610
Drunken Fist!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.550
Drink only after you turn 20!

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:04.500
Sasshi's doing awesome, but he looks so uncool.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:06.580
And that is...

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:09.620
What is that?

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:14.590
I don't get it! It's too hardcore, I don't get it!

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.590
Look! At his hair!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.670
You don't look good in blonde.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:23.970
Don't tell me he's going to do that!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.270
What is he, a monster?!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:27.430
Ka-

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.490
Ka-me-

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:29.500
Ka-me-ha-

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.570
Ka-me-ha-me

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:35.480
Damn it! Who is the greater geek should not be the decisive factor in a battle!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:38.570
And I'll prove it to you!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.020
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:40.950
I'll try it again.

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.110
Ka-

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:42.850
Ka-me-

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:43.720
Ka-me-ha-

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:44.000
Ka-me-ha-me

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.960
Damn it! Who is the greater geek...

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.040
The rest has been abridged.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.360
How could this be?

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:58.760
Does that yellow suit have a battleship class beam cannon?

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.810
What the heck was all that about?

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.510
Congratulations on your victory, Sasshi.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.160
Here you go.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.920
Huh? The kyonshii doll?

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:17.450
What's this?

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:21.870
Onii-chan!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:30.140
Let me see that doll, too!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.880
But, why? You worked so hard to win it.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.740
You wanted it, right? At Kouhei-san's shop.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.220
Are you saying it's for me?

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.650
Sasshi...

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.760
You sure really are dense.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:00.670
'Sides, you seriously think a girl in grade school...

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.100
...would want a kyonshii in this day and age?

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:05.030
Well, excuse me!

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:08.000
What? The talisman...

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:12.000
I don't need anything else as long as I get this back!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.340
Oh, it's a talisman that he wrote.

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:16.620
What?!

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.980
Then what about getting revenge and you telling me to win, huh?!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.020
That was to get this talisman back, of course.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:25.580
I couldn't care less about the Golden Claw.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.350
Oh, really.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.100
Oh, the talisman!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.200
Huh? What's going on?!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.000
Hey, hand over this talisman, too!

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.940
What the?! What the?!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.080
It came back to life because the talisman was removed!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.720
Then we gotta put that talisman back on!

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.350
No way! I finally got my hands on it!

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.750
I can't breathe...

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:54.990
Hand this one over, too!

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.680
This is no time for that!

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:59.690
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.510
Oh, the talisman!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.470
No! My talisman!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.170
Sasshi, what're ya looking at?! We're gonna get eaten!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:12.270
The talisman! The talisman!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:13.270
Talisman?!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.580
Hurry! Hurry! Paste it on its face!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:18.860
I can't get it off!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:24.570
Got it!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.600
Owowow...

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.190
Huh? My clothes are back.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.840
Oh, it's a goblin! So, it was you!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.470
Yes, yes, it is my defeat.

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.660
Speak one wish.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.540
Damn straight!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:52.340
Send us back to our real home this time!

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:55.150
Okay, okay.

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.820
Now, chant the spell.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.520
All things extant in this world...

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.740
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be...

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:13.900
All things extant in this world...

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.000
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be...

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:23.260
Hey, don't we gotta do all sorts of other things like make offerings?

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:25.450
Well, we will say that it is okay.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.950
It'll probably be okay.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:28.260
Don't say probably!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.870
Thus shall it be.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.390
What a nice day.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.500
Do ya think we got back like we're supposed to?

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:48.590
How peaceful.

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:51.010
Hey, it's a kite.

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.800
That thing looks like a kite to you?

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:54.630
It's pretty damn big.

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:57.280
Kites're like that these days.

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.080
It squawks out of its pointy beak...

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:04.970
Th-Th-Th-Th...

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.380
That's impossible!

00:22:08.860 --> 00:22:10.520
What is it this time?!

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.490
Now, on the next Magical Shopping Arcade Abenobashi...

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:50.590
Hold on a second!

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:53.160
Didn't ya promise that I'd get to do the next episode previews?!

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:55.000
I don't remember making a promise like that.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:56.400
You did, remember?!

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:58.800
Don't get all teary-eyed over something so silly.

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:00.230
Just do it.

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:02.270
Really? Then, then, then, I'm gonna do it, I'm gonna do it!

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:03.440
Do it already!

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:04.270
What should I say first?

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:05.310
You hadn't thought about it?

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:07.270
Now that it's time, I've got so much I wanna say.

00:24:07.270 --> 00:24:08.810
What kinda preview were ya planning on doing?

00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:11.680
Well, ya see, first, I'd look back just a bit on what happened in this episode, and then...

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:13.250
Oh, there's no time left.
